Original commit body from 2cc2832cf480fd99db2cdeeff5361e5667a9fbb7:

The typed-overload languages computed no stable_id and rode the ADR-0035
backstop floor key (kind, language, path, name), which same-name overloads
share: Julia f(x::Int) / f(x::String), CUDA and GLSL f(int) / f(float),
C++ pure virtuals find(int) / find(int, int) nulled each other.

- core c_family: c_family_parameter_list / c_family_parameters (moved from
  cpp.py, byte-identical meta.parameters) and c_family_scope_chain, shared
  by cpp, cuda and glsl (and hlsl in the scheme-bump batch).
- cuda: meta.parameters with types; declared_arity_stable_id, qualified
  name = enclosing namespaces/classes.
- glsl: same for functions; uniforms/in/out/varying/attribute take the
  formula with no arity.
- julia: positional parameters (::T types, defaults, splats; keyword
  params excluded: not dispatched on), module chain; macros, abstract
  types and consts migrated. `where` methods (full and short form) were
  not unwrapped and emitted no symbol; they are now emitted.
- fortran: dummy arguments typed from the unit's declarations (optional
  = default), unit chain (module/submodule/program/host procedure);
  programs and derived-type components migrated.
- cpp: pure virtuals record meta.parameters and mint
  declared_arity_stable_id (decorators abstract,virtual). cpp definitions
  are unchanged: their fix changes already-computed ids and is held for
  the scheme-bump batch.

Floor/null -> producer only: every previously producer-computed id is
byte-identical on the gate fixtures and a corpus sample (cuda/glsl/cpp/
sql 40 files, fortran 25, julia 1, hlsl 11, ada 9, pascal 40, plus 40 C++
files with pure virtuals; node and edge sets identical). Baseline:
julia/cuda/glsl/fortran and cpp method leave floor_and_null; julia, cuda,
glsl leave sibling_deletion_moves (cpp stays: definitions still tie).

Also: lean/tlaplus/wolfram wrote Symbol.meta post hoc from a parameter,
which the Edge.meta key gate reports as unresolved
(test_meta_key_coherence live-tree test failed on dev); meta now goes
through the Symbol constructor. base.py floor example, meta.parameters
producer counts (30 -> 33) and lean/tlaplus/cpp line citations updated.

